11
01:13:20,000 --> 01:13:26,000
It stars George Clooney as lawyer Michael Clayton, who discovers a
coverup of criminal wrongdoing by one of his firm's clients.

12
01:20:00,000 --> 01:20:06,000
Tom Wilkinson, Tilda Swinton, and Sydney Pollack appear in supporting roles.

13
01:26:40,000 --> 01:26:46,000
Released on October 5, 2007, the film grossed $93 million worldwide.

14
01:33:20,000 --> 01:33:26,000
It was praised for Gilroy's direction and screenplay, and the performances
of the cast, with Swinton's performance particularly lauded.

15
01:40:00,000 --> 01:40:06,000
Michael Clayton was nominated for seven Academy Awards: Best Picture, Best Director, Best Original Score, Best Original Screenplay,
Best Actor for Clooney, Best Supporting Actor for Wilkinson, and Best Supporting Actress for Swinton, which she won.

